lications using the sulfate process and the chloride process. Our high-performance TiO₂ products are key ingredients used to produce an enormous range of products including paints, plastics, inks, and paper. Click here to download technical information about our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigments.\n\n# LB Group simplifies the branding of its titanium dioxide pigments\n\n#### Media Contact\n\nJulie Reid, Marketing Director: LB Group, Winder House, Kingfisher Way, Stockton-on-Tees, TS18 3EX, UK\n\nT +44 (0)1642 692750  /  E juliereid@lomonbillions.global\n\n20\n\nSep/21\n\nAll News\n\nPrev\n\nNext\n\nOn 7 July 2021, Lomon billions Group Co., Ltd changed its name to LB Group Co., Ltd.\n\nThe company has simplified the branding of its titanium dioxide pigments.\n\nFrom September 20, 2021, all our titanium dioxide pigments are branded XUELIAN^{®} in China, and BILLIONS™ outside China. We will no-longer use the LOMON^{®} brand name. For example, LOMON^{®} R-996 is now BILLIONS™ R-996.\n\nThe new branding will appear in our marketing materials, and on the packaging we use for our titanium dioxide pigments.\n\nPlease be assured that only our product branding has changed. There is no change to the quality or specification of our titanium dioxide pigment products, or to our production processes, or to the materials we use for packaging.\n\nPlease contact your LB Group representative if you have any questions about these changes.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBillions Titanium Dioxide (https://www.fengbaigroup.com/billions-titanium-dioxide/)\nciteturn31search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; BILLIONS® titanium dioxide is the flagship TiO₂ brand of LB Group (Lomon Billions Group) , offering rutile-grade pigments produced via both sulfate and chloride processes. ... Lomon Billions titanium dioxide offers excellent whiteness, strong hiding power, high tinting strength, and outstanding dispersion.\n# Billions Titanium Dioxide\n\nBILLIONS® titanium dioxide is the flagship TiO₂ brand of LB Group (Lomon Billions Group) , offering rutile-grade pigments produced via both sulfate and chloride processes. The product range is widely used in coatings, plastics, inks, paper, and other industrial applications, delivering excellent whiteness, high hiding power, superior dispersion, strong weather resistance, and stable processing performance. It covers a full portfolio from general-purpose to high-performance grades to meet diverse application requirements.\n\n## Product Series of Billions® Titanium Dioxide\n\nCoatings-Grade Titanium Dioxide. Widely used in architectural coatings, industrial coatings, powder coatings, and automotive finishes. They are designed to deliver excellent weather resistance, gloss retention, hiding power, and long-term outdoor durability. Representative grades include BILLIONS R-996, BLR-895, and BLR-896, among which R-996 is a well-recognized general-purpose, high-durability grade widely used in interior and exterior coating systems.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLB Group | High performance titanium dioxide pigments (https://www.lomonbillions.global/)\nciteturn31search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Email: RAPS@lomonbillions.global ... ## BILLIONS™ BLR-852 TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENT FOR PAPER ... This alumina and phosphate-treated rutile titanium dioxide pigment has been designed by LB Group for use in the manufacture of decorative paper laminates.\n\n### About The Company\n\nLB Group is a leading manufacturer of high-performance titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments. Our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigment brand is established worldwide. We have over 35 years of TiO₂ pigment manufacturing experience. We manufacture a wide range of TiO₂ pigments for all major applications using the sulfate process and the chloride process. Our high-performance TiO₂ products are key ingredients used to produce an enormous range of products including paints, plastics, inks, and paper. Click here to download technical information about our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigments.\n\n\n### CSR\n\n“LB Group attaches great importance to corporate social responsibility and strives to operate in ways that enhance society and the environment”\nMr Gang Xu, Chairman\n\n##### Contact the Regulatory & Product Safety Team\n\nEmail: RAPS@lomonbillions.global\n\n### For Investors\n\nA dynamic business, a strong global presence – investing in the future\n\nShenzhen Stock Exchange 002601:SHENZHEN\n\n    * Board of Directors\nThe newly created company will operate as 𝗧𝗶𝗼𝘅𝗶𝗱𝗲  More\n\nVisit www.Tioxide.com for more information\n\n## BILLIONS™ TR53 TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENT FOR INKS\n\n### FOR REVERSE LAMINATE INKS\n\n#### MANUFACTURED BY THE SULFATE PROCESS\n\nTry BILLIONS™ TR53 titanium dioxide pigment, our latest TiO₂ pigment for inks.\n\nSpecifically designed by LB Group for use in reverse laminated printing inks, its specially selected alumina-silica surface treatment has been optimized to deliver excellent dispersion and high opacity in relevant resin systems.\n\nREQUEST A SAMPLE\n\n## NEW BILLIONS™ BLR-887 TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENT FOR PLASTICS\n\n### FOR HIGH QUALITY MASTERBATCHES\n\n#### MANUFACTURED BY THE CHLORIDE PROCESS\n\nSample NEW BILLIONS™ BLR-887 TiO₂ pigment, designed for manufacturers of high-quality masterbatches.\n\nUsed to prepare highly loaded masterbatches, high-temperature extrusion coatings and cast films, and engineering plastics, this TiO₂ pigment has been designed by LB Group to provide excellent processing performance, outstanding dispersion, good brightness, excellent tint strength, and a blue undertone.\n\nREQUEST A SAMPLE\n\n## NEW BILLIONS™ BLR-891 TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENT FOR COATINGS\n\n### HIGH-OPACITY FOR INTERIOR COATINGS AND E-COATINGS\n\n#### MANUFACTURED BY THE CHLORIDE PROCESS\n\nAsk for NEW BILLIONS™ BLR-891 pigment, the latest high-opacity TiO₂ pigment for coatings designed by LB Group.\n\nWith outstanding dispersion, excellent opacity, and tint strength, BILLIONS™ BLR-891 pigment is recommended for a range of interior architectural and industrial coatings applications and can also be used in e-coatings.\n\nREQUEST A SAMPLE\n\n## BILLIONS™ BLR-852 TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENT FOR PAPER\n\n### SPECIALLY DESIGNED FOR USE IN THE MANUFACTURE OF PAPER LAMINATES\n\n#### MANUFACTURED BY THE CHLORIDE PROCESS\n\nAsk for BILLIONS™ BLR-852 pigment for your decorative paper laminate formulations.\n\nThis alumina and phosphate-treated rutile titanium dioxide pigment has been designed by LB Group for use in the manufacture of decorative paper laminates. It provides excellent opacity and brightness and offers high light fastness and excellent retention properties. Also suitable for a range of other paper manufacturing applications.\n\nREQUEST A SAMPLE\n\n#### Contact\n\nFollow us on LinkedIn  /  Member of TDMA--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLB Group to promote new titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments for coatings and inks at ACS 2022 - LB Group | LB Group (https://www.lomonbillions.global/lb-group-at-acs-2022/)\nciteturn31search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.5 years ago; Crawled: 2 days ago; LB Group is a large Chinese chemical company listed on the Shenzhen stock exchange. ... In January 2022, our Board of Directors approved a 1 billion RMB (USD 157.6 million) investment at our Xiangyang site for the construction of a new 200ktpa titanium dioxide (TiO_{2}) pigment finishing plant. ... In July 2021, the company changed its name from Lomon Billions Group to LB Group.\nTwo TiO_{2} pigment finishing lines will be built, each with the ability to process 100ktpa TiO_{2} pigment intermediate product.”\n\nNew company name, and simplified product branding\n\nThere have been other changes too. In July 2021, the company changed its name from Lomon Billions Group to LB Group. “We’re in the process of preparing to list LB Group shares on the Hong Kong stock exchange,” says Julie. “In September 2021 we also simplified our TiO_{2} pigment product branding. All our titanium dioxide pigments are now branded XUELIAN^{®} in China, and BILLIONS™ outside China. For example, LOMON^{®} R-996 is now branded BILLIONS™ R-996.”\n\nDelivering high performance TiO_{2} pigments for coatings and inks\n\nLB Group manufactures a wide range of high-performance TiO_{2} pigments for coatings and inks including best-sellers like BILLIONS™ R-996 pigment, a highly durable sulfate-process TiO_{2} pigment designed for industrial and powder coatings and also suitable for durable external and internal architectural coatings; BILLIONS™ BLR-895 pigment, a chloride-process TiO_{2} pigment that delivers brilliant whiteness with a blue undertone in external and internal architectural coatings; and world-class BILLIONS™ TR52 pigment, a specialist sulfate-process TiO_{2} pigment designed specifically for printing inks.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntegrated Value Chain - LB Group | LB Group (https://www.lomonbillions.global/integrated-value-chain/)\nciteturn31search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; LB Group is a leading manufacturer of high-performance titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments.Our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigment brand is established worldwide. ... Email: RAPS@lomonbillions.global ... High-performance titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments for coatings, plastics, inks, and paper\n\n### About The Company\n\nLB Group is a leading manufacturer of high-performance titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments. Our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigment brand is established worldwide. We have over 35 years of TiO₂ pigment manufacturing experience. We manufacture a wide range of TiO₂ pigments for all major applications using the sulfate process and the chloride process. Our high-performance TiO₂ products are key ingredients used to produce an enormous range of products including paints, plastics, inks, and paper. Click here to download technical information about our BILLIONS™ TiO₂ pigments.\n\n\n##### Contact the Regulatory & Product Safety Team\n\nEmail: RAPS@lomonbillions.global\n\n\nShenzhen Stock Exchange 002601:SHENZHEN\n\n\nA LEADING MANUFACTURER OF HIGH PERFORMANCE TITANIUM DIOXIDE PIGMENTS - A GLOBAL BUSINESS - INVESTING IN THE FUTURE\n\nSHENZHEN LBG:002601\n\n# Integrated Value Chain\n\n#### About – More Information\n\n  * Key Facts\n  * Global Presence\n  * Company Timeline\n  * Integrated Value Chain\n  * Technical Excellence\n  * Environmental Responsibility\n\n### Our company is integrated both horizontally and vertically\n\nThe business consists of 3 main synergistic product lines:\n\n##### Titanium\n\nHigh-performance titanium dioxide (TiO₂) pigments for coatings, plastics, inks, and paper\n\nTitanium sponge, used to make titanium alloy and pure titanium metal\n\nTitanium alloy, used in the manufacture of air and spacecraft\n\nIlmenite and titanium slag\n\n##### Zirconium\n\nZrO_{2}, used to coat some TiO₂ pigments and in automotive catalysts\n\nZOC, used as powder grinding media and in ceramics\n\n##### Lithium-ion battery materials\n\nIron phosphate and lithium iron phosphate, used in the lithium battery energy industry\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBILLIONS™ brand by LB Group - Polymer additives (https://www.specialchem.com/polymer-additives/supplier/lb-group/billions)\nciteturn31search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; BILLIONS™ LR-108 by LB Group BILLIONS™ LR-108 by LB Group is a titanium dioxide pigment produced by the sulfate process.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLB Group will promote its high-performance titanium dioxide pigments for plastics at K2022 - LB Group | LB Group (https://www.lomonbillions.global/lb-group-will-promote-its-high-performance-titanium-dioxide-pigments-for-plastics-at-k2022/)\nciteturn31search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.9 years ago; Crawled: